      just written), unlike the macOS status below:
  [x] frontends/windows/{main.c,resource.h,resource.rc,app.manifest.in,
      CMakeLists.txt} + debugger/dbg_window.{h,c} +
      keypad/keypad_window.{h,c}: same layout/scope as the GNOME/KDE
